Expect 1 child 0 string >
Expect 1 child 1 tag keyword
Expect 1 child 1 string Split
Expect 1 child 2 tag distance
Expect 1 child 2 string 100m
Expect 1 child 3 tag speed
Expect 1 child 3 string 2:45/100m

